IBM Daily Stock Prices — Alpha Vantage
Version: 1.0
Source: Alpha Vantage API — Time Series Daily endpoint
Symbol: IBM (International Business Machines)
Data Range: 2025-12-26 to 2026-05-20
Record Count: 100 trading days

Overview
This database stores daily OHLCV (Open, High, Low, Close, Volume) price data for IBM stock sourced from the Alpha Vantage API. The schema is designed to support multi-symbol expansion, API metadata tracking, and derived analytics, while keeping raw price data normalized and auditable.

