Constraints & Business Rules

No duplicate (symbol, date) pairs in daily_prices.
high_price must be ≥ all other price columns for the same row.
low_price must be ≤ all other price columns for the same row.
All price values must be positive.
Volume must be non-negative (zero is valid on scheduled non-trading days if included).
Every price row must reference a valid symbol_id (enforced by FK).
